{"id":"01a06586-0a68-7050-842b-875a990ad05f","chapterSlug":"rw7-48 K","paragraph":421,"wording":"[Thug]","event":"named","holderQuote":"The [Thief] nodded. Wilovan adjusted his jacket. Neither one said it. Of course, it was just an observation. Of course they weren’t being paid to investigate. But they were [Thief] and [Thug]."}
{"id":"01a06586-0a68-77cc-89be-b64d4c8a99dc","chapterSlug":"rw7-52","paragraph":267,"wording":"[Thug]","event":"named","claimed":true,"claimedBySlug":"wilovan","holderQuote":"That was easier to understand. Wilovan tipped his hat as Erin turned back from the [Mages]."}
